    <string name="menu_about">About shortcuts</string>
    <string name="about_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="about_msg">Icon Studio adds a custom shortcut to your home screen with the image and name you choose. Tapping it opens the original app.\n\nIt does not change the app\'s real icon in Android or in the app drawer; the original app stays as it is. If you want, hide or remove the original icon from your home screen yourself.\n\nAll images are processed on your phone. This app has no internet access and no ads.</string>

